# The Dockerfile only COPYs docker/requirements.txt, ros2_ws/src, and
# docker/entrypoint.sh. Everything else is bind-mounted at runtime via
# docker-compose, so shipping it to the daemon as build context just makes
# every build slower -- demos/ alone is ~2 GB.
#
# Exclude everything, then re-add only what the build actually reads.
*

!docker/requirements.txt
!docker/entrypoint.sh
!ros2_ws/src/

# ...but not the build artifacts that colcon leaves inside src/.
ros2_ws/src/**/__pycache__/
ros2_ws/src/**/*.pyc
